=Generator=
{{img:units/Generator.png}}
* Health: 8
* Price: {{img:Minerals.png}} 40
* Scanning range: 2
*Consumes: {{img:Fuel.png}}10
*Produces: {{img:Energy.png}}20
Enabled generators provide energy for the local compound. Since many structures consume {{img:Energy.png}} when enabled, generators are a crucial component of any active base. Combine with reactor cores for increased output.
